---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Timeline
eyebrow: Explore
summary: Significant events drawn from Mandan’s historical record, arranged chronologically.
navigation:
  key: timeline
  label: Timeline
  order: 36
permalink: /timeline/
---
{% set groups = collections.records | timelineGroups %}

<p class="notice">
  This timeline is curated rather than exhaustive. It emphasizes significant
  community events and excludes routine birth and death dates or incidental
  years mentioned in passing.
</p>

<div class="timeline">
  {% for group in groups %}
    <section class="timeline-decade" aria-labelledby="timeline-{{ group.decade }}">
      <h2 id="timeline-{{ group.decade }}">{{ group.decade }}</h2>
      <ol>
        {% for event in group.events %}
          <li>
            <time datetime="{{ event.date }}">{{ event.displayDate or event.date }}</time>
            <div>
              <p>{{ event.label }}</p>
              <a href="{{ event.record.url }}">{{ event.record.data.title }}</a>
            </div>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
